
distance = int(input("Enter distance in km: "))
age = int(input("Enter passenger age: "))
travel_class = input("Enter class (Sleeper/AC): ")

if distance <= 100:
    fare = distance * 1
elif distance <= 500:
    fare = distance * 1.5
else:
    fare = distance * 2

if travel_class == "AC":
    fare = fare * 2

if age >= 60:
    fare = fare * 0.9

reservation_fee = 30
total = fare + reservation_fee

print("Base Fare: Rs.", round(fare, 2))
print("Reservation Fee: Rs.", reservation_fee)
print("Total Fare: Rs.", round(total, 2))

cancel = input("Cancel ticket? (yes/no): ")

if cancel == "yes":
    penalty = total * 0.2
    print("Cancellation Penalty: Rs.", round(penalty, 2))
    print("Refund: Rs.", round(total - penalty, 2))

Algorithm
1. Start.
2. Enter required validity days, budget and daily data usage.
3. Store the details of available mobile plans.
4. Check each plan's data, validity and price.
5. Select plans satisfying all three conditions.
6. Find the cheapest eligible plan.
7. Display the best plan and its cost.
8. If no plan qualifies, display “No eligible plan within budget”.
9. Stop.
Example and Sample Output
Sample Input
Enter required validity days: 28
Enter your budget: 300
Enter required data per day in GB: 2
Calculation: Plan A costs ₹199 and meets all requirements. Plan B also qualifies but costs ₹299.

Sample Output
Best Plan: Plan A
Plan Cost: 199

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[/Enter passenger details, distance and travel class/]
    B --> C[Calculate base fare using distance slab]
    C --> D[Apply class charges]
    D --> E{Passenger eligible for age concession?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Apply age concession]
    E -->|No| G[Keep original fare]
    F --> H[Add reservation fee]
    G --> H
    H --> I[/Display passenger fare/]
    I --> J{Cancellation requested?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Calculate cancellation penalty]
    J -->|No| L[Keep reservation active]
    K --> M[Calculate refund amount]
    M --> N[/Display penalty and refund/]
    L --> O([STOP])
    N --> O
```


